    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="21.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 21.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="21.1" corresp="#wit-h">Ðanne is cirican canne riht:</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">Ðanne is cirican canne riht.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">(This,) then is the church’s right of exculpation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">The Church has further prerogatives with regard to expurgation, [which are] as follows:</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Ferner ist der Kirche Reinigungsvorrecht:</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Further, the Church’s privilege of exculpation is:</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
